What is claimed is:
1. A computer-implemented method for dynamic valuation of user generated data assets, comprising:
receiving, at a computing platform, a plurality of user data elements from disparate data sources;
authenticating ownership of each user unifying the data elements using a verification protocol;
generating a user data profile comprising the authenticated data elements;
calculating a valuation score for the user data profile based on at least one of: recency, completeness, uniqueness, and market demand;
issuing a digital token representing the user data profile, wherein the token includes metadata corresponding to the valuation score;
